From: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:54:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Add ESP32 board definitions and memory maps

Define the C3/C5/C6/H2/S31 and both P4 revision layouts, ROM reserves,
direct-boot ABI, public BSP interface and RAM execution regions.

Consolidates legacy kernel patches: 0001, 0003, 0004, 0005, 0008, 0009,
0011, 0012, 0014, 0015, 0017, 0020, 0033, 0035, 0036, 0037, 0039, 0046.

Co-authored-by: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
